2. Terrain heightmaps -- public/terrain/*.png, public/terrain/*.json

   Bundled in this repository. Downsampled (8 m/pixel) from the WARDOGS
   landscape collision data published by the same upstream project
   (wardogs-landscape-collision-u16-v1). These are derived from game data and
   are NOT covered by the MIT License above. Absolute heights use an offset
   datum, so the app only ever displays the difference between two points
   (Delta-Z), never an absolute elevation.

3. Map tiles -- public/tiles/<map>/zoom_<z>/<x>_<y>.webp

   Bundled in this repository, zoom 0..3 only (2048 px per map edge, 8 m/pixel),
   downloaded from the upstream project's asset CDN by scripts/download-tiles.py.
   These are WARDOGS game assets, are NOT covered by the MIT License above, and
   remain the property of their respective copyright holders.

   The upstream CDN rejects requests from other origins (HTTP 403), so it is not
   used as a runtime tile host. Set VITE_TILE_BASE at build time to serve tiles
   from a host of your own instead.

